card.statement:
For $\pi_0:\{1,...,n\} \onto \{1,...,m\}$ and $\pi_1:\{1,...,m\}\to \{1,...,\ell\}$ order preserving surjections as above, the diagram

\begin{equation}
\begin{tikzcd}
\WW^{\underline{\lambda}}_{\mu} \ar[rr,twoheadrightarrow, "\varpi^{\underline{\lambda},\pi_1\circ \pi_0 }_{\mu}"]\ar[dr,twoheadrightarrow,"\varpi^{\underline{\lambda},\pi_0}_{\mu}"] & & \WW^{\underline{\lambda}_{\pi_1\circ \pi_0}}_\mu \\
& \WW^{\underline{\lambda}_{\pi_0}}_\mu \ar[ur,swap, twoheadrightarrow,"\varpi^{\underline{\lambda}_{\pi_0},\pi_1}_{\mu}"]
\end{tikzcd}
\end{equation}

naturally commutes.
